{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_014mir_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_002_1000_p", "source_sha256": "aa1327fa4c924bb3f3958e204be457233295c31204b15c84c17271648df14a8f", "ja": "（今日は未来の宣材写真を撮るために、\nスタジオにやってきた）", "zh": "（今天为了拍未来的宣传照，\n我们来到了摄影棚。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_014mir_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_002_1001_014mir", "source_sha256": "9eab071cf81acbae64f22a96e5048dd95b793a94984197ad4b362a3a6d3556bc", "ja": "本物のスタジオだー！　{$P$}さん、\nおっきいカメラが、たっくさんありますよ！", "zh": "是真正的摄影棚耶──！{$P$}先生，\n这里有好多好大的照相机喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_014mir_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_002_1002_014mir", "source_sha256": "6e241a8e470946971bd9e56a313d54b7473880be570c00eebf7e0218f04614e3", "ja": "ここで、センザイシャシンを撮るんですか？\nなんだか本物のアイドルみたいですね！　でへへ……♪", "zh": "要在这里拍所谓的宣传照是吗？\n感觉就像真正的偶像一样呢！嘿嘿……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_014mir_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_002_1003_014mir", "source_sha256": "d8fae61c181c49a6664267df9c9c6a4f0cfec5fe51d46e2240b279ed31bc5a75", "ja": "あれ……？\nでも、センザイシャシンってなんだっけ？？", "zh": "咦……？\n但宣传照到底是什么呢？？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_014mir_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_002_1004_p", "source_sha256": "d05c3e5e365236112002e4c6ff44b773fd0bfe1d1c2242c575fae6b70630e570", "ja": "未来が、これからアイドルとしてたくさん\n仕事できるように、宣伝するための写真のことだよ。", "zh": "是为了让未来今后能以偶像身分接下许多工作，\n用来进行宣传的照片。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_014mir_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_002_1005_p", "source_sha256": "33260e6954a914706050aa99c110cc6a53aed5a5459d9371d08a981f65a8e072", "ja": "そしてこの撮影自体が、未来がアイドルになった、\n最初の仕事だな！", "zh": "而这次的拍摄，\n就是未来当上偶像的第一份工作！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_014mir_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_002_1006_014mir", "source_sha256": "fc8dc35eabc4679b7e42158a35c6e262063c986402f5598d78424003f4efcaeb", "ja": "なるほど～。そういうことなら、\n気合い入れて挑戦しないとですね！", "zh": "原来如此～既然是这样，\n我可得打起干劲来挑战！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_014mir_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_002_1007_014mir", "source_sha256": "76bbb1b5db3fe3a200fbf64c4c863ff9e678ebb1640d045707e522db9c792c39", "ja": "よ～し、頑張るぞー！　おー♪", "zh": "很好～我要好好加油啰──！看我的──♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_014mir_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_002_1008_null", "source_sha256": "6dea450594b09caec8501ed7659bf7799fbf5b87d1c5673c556cfb904e22dc27", "ja": "そして、\n撮影が始まった……", "zh": "接着，\n就开始拍摄了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_014mir_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_002_1009_014mir", "source_sha256": "ec8befededbaf9bb8efb5cceebafc8599fa03c821f1e80c7dd0e8eb864a22a1d", "ja": "うぅ……\n{$P$}さ～ん。", "zh": "呜呜……\n{$P$}先生～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_014mir_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_002_1010_p", "source_sha256": "493c3316d7ae842c2443aec2b81bfd69d089c3bc657849946b24f06ef2ea2fe3", "ja": "どうしたんだ？　未来。", "zh": "怎么啦，未来？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_014mir_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_002_1011_014mir", "source_sha256": "ce6d68b2ddec388e0c8a4c6b22de4bb8ab608020a0075afecd900188d0e51e2d", "ja": "おしとやかなポーズばっかり取ってたら、\n足がしびれてきちゃいました……うう……。", "zh": "一直维持端庄的姿势，\n我脚都开始麻了……呜呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_014mir_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_002_1012_p", "source_sha256": "8f992e490d9941de6a53b9637b14e988b4285e1d77cbd8f39c70c1a43c56339c", "ja": "そ、そうか。それだけ無理があるってことは……。\nそういうポーズは、ちょっと未来らしくないのかもな。", "zh": "是、是吗？既然对你来说这么勉强……\n就代表这种姿势可能不太适合未来呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_014mir_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_002_1013_014mir", "source_sha256": "eb60e185eb015773ada1c1666e5c628dcef8733e6db9630225cdc933ab75a77f", "ja": "私らしくない、ですか？", "zh": "不太适合我吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_014mir_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_002_1014_p", "source_sha256": "5645db27f86b1f443b285eaa60ff8b9e5a473c230a8c5e87756cce32f8dd2fb3", "ja": "うん。\n試しに、未来の好きなように撮ってみないか？", "zh": "嗯，\n要不要试着按未来的喜好来拍？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_014mir_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_002_1015_014mir", "source_sha256": "08a316bcc8e566a2322c9bc01b7ceefed019c0af0adcc824da222e5c178f6781", "ja": "えーっ、いいんですか！？　じゃあじゃあ、\nライブの衣装とか……あっ、お姫様のドレスとか！？", "zh": "咦──可以吗！？那么那么，\n穿着演唱会服装之类的……啊，公主洋装如何！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_014mir_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_002_1016_014mir", "source_sha256": "b7e5f6d1dee11cc7daac9a39864f612c5d86f0316924f01893bbd4a9d360664c", "ja": "あとは、えーっと……花火とか紙吹雪を、\nばばーんって打ち上げてみたり！", "zh": "还有啊，我想想……\n背景再配上华丽的烟火或纸花！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_014mir_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_002_1017_p", "source_sha256": "5e91499832a99a7b0bad257aaf37a8c4cfcae3f2c77ff1b6bbfe6ffb7f2e5d73", "ja": "いや、そうじゃなくて……好きなようにっていうのは、\nシチュエーションじゃなくて、ポーズのこと。", "zh": "不，不是那种……所谓按你的喜好，\n指的不是情境，而是拍照姿势。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_014mir_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_002_1018_014mir", "source_sha256": "7866a738790d2a91c0778011a16bbb785bf47b26c090d531feaaf16aab917285", "ja": "ポーズですか？\nえっと、それじゃあ……。", "zh": "姿势吗？\n我想想，那么就……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_014mir_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_002_1019_se", "source_sha256": "7d37269cd3530b9657d1d5a029bdf004162f4d31c7aefdaaf7f0c578d7d3765b", "ja": "パシャッ！　パシャッ！", "zh": "喀嚓！喀嚓！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_014mir_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_002_1020_014mir", "source_sha256": "d39562df03e19726afdef2302591ffb48b1c4a6a012df0bf081adb0d45442cf7", "ja": "{$P$}さん！　\n今、どうでしたか！？", "zh": "{$P$}先生！\n刚才拍的照片怎么样！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_014mir_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_002_1021_p", "source_sha256": "c6b946a36321247f88a50f1f57429da38a78d577f54f485798c2240060357495", "ja": "ジャンプした瞬間の写真か……。\nうん、元気に写ってるな。いいと思う！", "zh": "跳跃瞬间的照片啊……\n嗯，拍得很有活力，我觉得很棒！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_014mir_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_002_1022_014mir", "source_sha256": "e3b1639e050a8a1d9146e29846a184d968bb0b19c988cd8e6ee3a9471378fe5d", "ja": "私も、この写真が一番お気に入りです！\n空を飛んでるみたいで、カッコいいですよね！", "zh": "我最喜欢的也是这张照片！\n好像飞在空中一样，很帅吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_014mir_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_002_1023_014mir", "source_sha256": "b799fd2041fe454136ce2594e60683adcea5d52d9f8007a86c032acee78a82d1", "ja": "えへへ♪\nもっといっぱい撮ってもらっちゃお～っと！", "zh": "嘿嘿♪\n那再帮我多拍几张吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_014mir_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_002_1024_p", "source_sha256": "535954ca32d095c5eba2e953a300a3391257f4415054b6f8781481da22b00204", "ja": "（それから未来は、ジャンプしたり走ったりと、\n動き回っているところを、たくさん撮ってもらった）", "zh": "（之后未来又跑又跳，\n让摄影师拍下各种活泼的动作。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_014mir_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_014mir_002_1025_p", "source_sha256": "b783afb801711bd95dcfd6cd38401a99d36a53ed1f24b9c9432efd3582e42f73", "ja": "（どの写真も生き生きとして、魅力的だ。\n未来のアピールポイントが見えてきたな！）", "zh": "（每张照片都很有朝气跟魅力。\n看来找到未来的卖点了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
